# MedInsight: Production Deployment Plan

## Architecture

```
┌─────────────────────┐        ┌──────────────────────┐
│  Vercel (Frontend)  │◄──────►│  Railway (Backend)   │
│  Next.js 16         │  HTTP  │  FastAPI + Uvicorn    │
└─────────────────────┘        └──────────┬───────────┘
                                          │ psycopg2
                                ┌─────────▼───────────┐
                                │  Neon (Database)     │
                                │  PostgreSQL (free)   │
                                └──────────────────────┘
```

| Service | Platform | Free Tier |
|---------|----------|-----------|
| Frontend | [Vercel](https://vercel.com) | ✅ Unlimited |
| Backend | [Railway](https://railway.app) | ✅ 500 hrs/mo |
| Database | [Neon](https://neon.tech) | ✅ 512MB |

> [!IMPORTANT]
> Your PostgreSQL tables won't be auto-created. You must run the schema SQL on Neon after signup. Use the schema from your `database/` or `docs/` folder in the backend.

---

## Proposed Changes

### Database

#### Step 1 – Neon Setup
1. Go to [neon.tech](https://neon.tech) → Create account → New Project → `healthcare_db`
2. Copy the **connection string** (format: `postgresql://user:pass@host/db?sslmode=require`)
3. Open **SQL Editor** and run your existing schema from `backend/database/` or `backend/docs/`

