#### [NEW] Procfile

Railway uses this to start the server:
```
web: gunicorn main:app -w 2 -k uvicorn.workers.UvicornWorker --bind 0.0.0.0:$PORT
```

---

#### [NEW] .env (local only, gitignored)

```
DATABASE_URL=postgresql://postgres:postgres@localhost:5432/healthcare_db
ALLOWED_ORIGINS=http://localhost:3000
```

